  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2fabfc503d1abde4ab2527103056f87a, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC Ken
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 \u0111i nh\u1EB7t ph\u1EBF li\u1EC7u xung quanh khu v\u1EF1c
    n\xE0y."
  - "T\xF4i nghe ng\xF3ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1EB1ng g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y c\xF3
    m\u1ED9t t\xEAn qu\xE1i v\u1EADt c\u1EF1c k\xEC t\xE0 \xE1c..."
  - "...m\u1EB7c d\xF9 v\u1EADy h\u1EAFn ta l\u1EA1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB ti\xEAu
    di\u1EC7t b\u1EDFi ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa thu\u1EA7n khi\u1EBFt."
  - "C\xF3 l\u1EBD t\xF4i kh\xF4ng n\xEAn \u1EDF l\u1EA1i \u0111\xE2y l\xE2u n\u1EEFa"
